<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore July official reserves rise to 102.9-MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore July official reserves rise to 102.9-MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves.</p>
<p>(in billions of Singapore dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>					     July	 June     July '95</p>
<p>    Total official reserves	  102.90     101.96    94.05</p>
<p>    Gold and foreign exchange	102.22     101.29    93.37</p>
<p>    Special drawing rights (million)   243.30	240.40    238.70</p>
<p>Reserve Position in IMF (million)  434.50	429.30    445.20</p>
<p>Source: Monetary Authority of Singapore</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703199</p>
